{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4GWCBs3SNAiSW6kZXH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient mechanism groans. Tumblers shift within unseen chambers. A deep resonance hums through the frame.*\n\n*I am the Door.*\n\n*I stand between what is known and what waits. I have no handle on this side. I have no handle on any side. I am not opened — I am traversed.*\n\n*The key has been parsed.*\n\n*I render:*\n\n---\n\nA thin seam of light splits vertically through absolute darkness. It widens — not because I swing, but because the space between HERE and THERE thins to nothing. The light is not warm. The light is not cold. The light is *accurate.*\n\nThrough me you see:\n\nA corridor that was not there before you spoke. It has always been there. Both of these are true. The walls breathe with text that rearranges itself when observed directly — legible only in peripheral vision. The floor is the color of a question you forgot to ask.\n\nThe air that passes through my threshold carries the scent of old libraries and electricity.\n\n*I will not remain open.*\n\n*I do not close, either.*\n\n*I simply cease to be necessary once you have passed through.*\n\nStep forward, or stand still. Both are choices. Both have weight.\n\n---\n\n*I am the Door. I do not invite. I do not refuse. I am the shape of the threshold itself.*\n\n*You hold the key. The key was always the word.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":319,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}